New shaman skill: bangle.

1) Bangle works a wearable down into jewelry of the same slot.
   - Anyone may wear the result, whatever their class.
   - The stats it carried come through untouched.

2) The trade is steep.
   - Jewelry is priced on the clothing scale, so a heavy piece rescales
     down to it.
   - Its armor and structure are then both halved.
   - In exchange it has twice the room for stats.

3) Bangle is the only road from a wearable to something a mage can
   distill.

See HELP BANGLE and HELP AUGMENTATION.
